  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "28",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "28",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sauli Na Mchawi Wa Endori",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku zile Wafilisti wakakusanya majeshi yao ili kupigana vita dhidi ya Israeli. Akishi akamwambia Daudi, \"Lazima ujue kuwa wewe pamoja na watu wako mtafuatana nami kwenda vitani.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi akasema, \"Ndipo wewe mwenyewe utakapojionea jambo ambalo mtumishi wako anaweza kufanya.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 28:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akishi akamjibu Daudi, \"Vyema sana, mimi nitakufanya uwe mlinzi wangu daima.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati huo Samweli alikuwa amekufa, nao Israeli wote walikuwa wamemwombolezea na kumzika kwenye mji wake mwenyewe huko Rama. Sauli alikuwa amewafukuza waaguzi na wachawi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wafilisti wakakusanyika na kupiga kambi yao huko Shunemu, naye Sauli akawakusanya Waisraeli wote na kupiga kambi yao huko Gilboa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauli alipoona jeshi la Wafilisti, akaogopa; moyo wake ukajawa na hofu kuu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Sauli akauliza ushauri kwa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.28.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.28.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", lakini",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.28.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.28.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hakumjibu kwa ndoto, wala kwa Urimu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "wala kwa njia ya manabii.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi Sauli akawaambia watumishi wake, \"Nitafutieni mwanamke mwaguzi ili nimwendee, nipate kuuliza kwake.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 28:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Watumishi wake wakamwambia, \"Yuko mwanamke mmoja huko Endori.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hivyo Sauli akajigeuza kwa kuvaa mavazi mengine, naye usiku akiwa amefuatana na watu wawili wakaenda kwa huyo mwanamke. Akamwambia, \"Nibashirie kwa uaguzi, unipandishie yule nitakayekutajia.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Huyo mwanamke akamwambia, \"Wewe unajua lile alilofanya Mfalme Sauli. Amewakatilia mbali waaguzi, wapiga ramli wote na wachawi katika nchi. Mbona umenitegea maisha yangu ili wapate kuniua?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauli akamwapia huyo mwanamke kwa Jina la",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.28.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.28.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", akasema, \"Kwa hakika kama",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.28.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.28.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aishivyo, hutaadhibiwa kwa ajili ya jambo hili.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo yule mwanamke akauliza, \"Je unataka nikupandishie nani?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 28:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sauli akasema, \"Nipandishie Samweli.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yule mwanamke alipomwona Samweli, alipiga yowe kwa sauti kuu, naye akamuuliza Sauli, \"Mbona umenidanganya? Wewe ndiwe Sauli.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalme akamwambia, \"Usiogope. Unaona nini?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 28:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yule mwanamke akasema, \"Naona mungu unapanda kutoka ardhini.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauli akamuuliza, \"Ni mfano wa nini?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 28:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yule mwanamke akasema, \"Ni mwanaume mzee amevaa joho anayepanda.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 28:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Sauli akatambua kwamba ni Samweli. Sauli akasujudu kifudifudi, uso wake hadi ardhini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samweli akamuuliza Sauli, \"Kwa nini unanitaabisha kwa kunipandisha juu?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 28:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sauli akasema, \"Mimi ninasumbuka sana, kwa maana Wafilisti wanapigana vita dhidi yangu, naye Mungu ameniacha. Hanijibu tena wala kwa njia ya manabii wala kwa ndoto. Kwa hiyo nimekuita wewe ili unijulishe la kufanya.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samweli akamuuliza, \"Kwa nini uniulize mimi, maadamu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.28.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.28.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amekuacha na kuwa adui yako?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.28.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.28.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ametenda lile alilotangulia kusema kupitia kwangu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.28.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.28.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ameurarua ufalme kutoka mikononi mwako, naye amempa mmoja wa jirani zako, yaani Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa sababu wewe hukumtii",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.28.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.28.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", wala hukumtimizia ghadhabu yake kali juu ya Waamaleki,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.28.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.28.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amekutendea mambo haya leo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zaidi ya hayo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.28.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.28.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "atawatia Israeli pamoja na wewe mikononi mwa Wafilisti, na kesho wewe na wanao mtakuwa pamoja nami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.28.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.28.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pia atalitia jeshi la Israeli mikononi mwa Wafilisti.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Papo hapo Sauli akaanguka chini, akajinyoosha, akiwa amejawa na hofu kwa ajili ya maneno ya Samweli. Nguvu zake zikamwishia kwa maana alikuwa hajala chochote mchana ule wote na usiku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yule mwanamke alipomwendea Sauli na kumwona amepatwa na hofu, akamwambia, \"Tazama, mimi mtumishi wako mwanamke nimekutii. Nimeweka maisha yangu hatarini kwa kufanya kile ulichoniagiza nifanye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sasa tafadhali isikilize sauti ya mtumishi wako, uniruhusu nikupatie chakula kidogo ule ili uwe na nguvu za kurejea ulikotoka.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akakataa, akisema, \"Mimi sitaki kula.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 28:23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lakini watumishi wake wakaungana na yule mwanamke wakamsihi ale, naye akakubali. Basi akainuka hapo chini, akaketi juu ya kitanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yule mwanamke alikuwa na ndama aliyenona hapo nyumbani, akamchinja mara moja. Akachukua unga, akaukanda, akatengeneza mkate usio chachu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo akamwandalia meza Sauli pamoja na watu wake, nao wakala. Usiku ule ule wakainuka na kwenda zao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
